One of the things that I
really loved about this paper

00:12:11.440 --> 00:12:12.870
is the power,

00:12:12.870 --> 00:12:15.060
you know I think we all feel

00:12:15.060 --> 00:12:17.840
that like statistics
must involve, you know,

00:12:17.840 --> 00:12:22.840
in order for us to make
kind of like real clinical,

00:12:23.310 --> 00:12:25.660
like recommendations or suggestions,

00:12:25.660 --> 00:12:28.370
it requires hundreds of
thousands of data points,

00:12:28.370 --> 00:12:31.170
which I think for like
